# Allowlisted build context: deny everything, then allow only the
# Docker build inputs, the application source, and the propensity package.
# NBA artifacts are mounted at run time and never enter the build context.
*

!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!app
!app/**
!src
!src/propensity
!src/propensity/**

# Secret/cache exclusions inside the permitted source trees.
app/**/__pycache__
app/**/*.pyc
app/**/.env
app/**/.env.*
src/**/__pycache__
src/**/*.pyc
src/**/.env
src/**/.env.*
